{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56401","headline":"踵韵和兄见寄之作（题拟） · 冯友义","name":"踵韵和兄见寄之作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"势利鸿毛眼底轻，异居忍背雁行情。\n薛包让德千年烈，太伯存仁万古清。\n弃礼乱伦趋薄俗，分门割户总浮名。\n悬悬早发归家念，幷奏埙篪乐弟兄。\n（同前。\n冯氏兄弟诗承张靖龙同志录示。\n）（按：冯氏兄弟事迹不见唐宋时记载，诗意亦颇俚俗，疑出後人依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯友义","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}